# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
#
# Serial script for ci/test-install (0.0.4.3, docs/decisions.md D106, D110): answers
# systemd-sysinstall's prompts as a person would. The blank target disk is the only candidate,
# which the prompt fills in. After the installation, sysinstall waits for a key before it reboots.
expect Please enter target disk device: /dev/disk/by-id/virtio-target
sleep 1
send \n
expect Please type 'yes' to confirm
sleep 1
send yes\n
expect Press any key to proceed
sleep 1
send \n
